fabric/**/*.log

# Hyperledger Fabric generated crypto material
**/keystore/
**/signcerts/
**/cacerts/
**/tlscacerts/
**/tls/
*_sk
*.pem
*.crt
*.key

# Keep Fabric source/config files
!fabric/
!fabric/chaincode/
!fabric/chaincode/**
!fabric/configtx/
!fabric/configtx/**
!fabric/scripts/
!fabric/scripts/**
!fabric/docker-compose.fabric.yml
